{"id":77783763309884,"name":"PARRY!!","desc":"PARRY, the game where you SWING and DASH and PARRY and DASH and SWING AND PARRY\n(version 3.1.0!)\n\nCURRENTLY FEATURINGGG 2 gamemodes, 2.5 weapons, 3 stages (campaign), 2.5 mini stages, 11 unique enemies, and 4 bosses!! if that doesnt sound cool, idk what does.\nAND all the above numbers will go UP with updates.\n\nBASE CONTROLS (in case you forget)\nM1 (R2 or X): melee\nF (R1 or Y): parry\nE (L2): counter\nQ (B): dash\nT (DPadUp): TAUNT\nCTRL (DPadDown): unlock camera\nR (L1): overcharge (but only if you have that upgrade)\nZ (DPadLeft): ability (only if you have that too)\n\nSUPPORTS computer, mobile, and console (at least the xbox controller, tell me if other controllers dont work)\n\n\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\n\nPLAY ABOVE 60 FPS AT YOUR OWN RISK! i forgot that was a thing until i made most the game, so some stuff goes really fast. my bad.\n\nbtw im not selling this game, and i probably never will. if someone is trying to sell it as me, its a scam.","path":"/game/77783763309884-parry","slug":"77783763309884-parry","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0c0d270f14aa3a65b00ec37f0bcd118f152a85f8ce2933633e520e25023f5728.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e27072c978955e0ef476ecbfe02dfa0b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":55,"visitor":20206718,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-02T18:55:23.228Z","creator":{"name":"Red Aircraft","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"PARRY!!-Auto-parry-210977","_id":"69f6489b5aa7b79b960ca777","title":"Auto parry","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77f38","gameId":77783763309884,"name":"PARRY!!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":77783763309884},"features":"Auto parry\nKill aura\nTeleport to mobs","tags":[],"script"